# This applies to Dockerfile.source, whose context is the repository root. The
# release path is unaffected either way: dockers_v2 builds from a temporary
# context of its own holding the Dockerfile and the staged binaries, and never
# reads this file.
#
# Excluded by name rather than as a blanket `*`, so that a Dockerfile which
# later does need something from the tree fails in review instead of at tag
# time, where the tag has already been cut.
.git
.github
agent
dist
docs
internal
cmd
scripts

# Left by `go test -c`; 58MB of context that no image has any use for.
*.test
coverage.out
